	(text "Values from the schematic:\n+6V = 1.238 V x (1 + R17/R15) = 1.238 x (1 + 69.8k/18k)\n+5VA = ISET x RSET = 100 uA x 50k (R9)\nPG threshold = 0.3 V x (1 + R12/R13) = 4.59 V\nLT3042 soft-start: tau = RSET x CSET = 50k x 2.2 uF\n     = 110 ms  ->  +5VA at 99 % after ~550 ms"
