	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\nThe LT3042 SET capacitor (C14 = 2.2 uF) gives a 110 ms time constant. Firmware must wait >= 600 ms after power-up (or until PG, TP17) before the AD7190 reset and internal calibration. To start faster, reduce C14 (e.g. 0.47 uF -> tau = 23.5 ms) at the cost of slightly more noise."
